BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.20 0.25 rg 50.00 170.39 Td (Flask handles concurrent requests using multiple worker threads. Standard Python) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.20 0.25 rg 50.00 158.89 Td (dictionaries are not safe against simultaneous write/pop operations across threads. Without) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.20 0.25 rg 50.00 147.39 Td (synchronization, concurrent accesses could cause race conditions or KeyError exceptions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.20 0.25 rg 50.00 135.89 Td (threading.Lock\(\) guarantees mutually exclusive, atomic cache operations.) Tj ET
