BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.20 0.25 rg 50.00 708.89 Td (checks if isinstance\(val, bool\) to block booleans from passing as integer counts.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.20 0.25 rg 56.00 697.39 Td (4. Strict Range Clamping: Record count is capped between 1 and 10,000; random seed is) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.20 0.25 rg 50.00 685.89 Td (limited to 32-bit unsigned int.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.15 0.20 0.25 rg 56.00 674.39 Td (5. Secure Tokens: Secrets are generated with secrets.token_urlsafe\(24\) rather than) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.18 0.20 0.25 rg 50.00 662.89 Td (predictable timestamps.) Tj ET
